  "description": "A friend who passed out while drinking suddenly said something strange.\n\n*\"Su-Hyeok, I've regressed.\"\n\"Regressed?\"\n\"Yes, I've come back in time.\"\n\"Are you crazy?\"\n\"You are the only hope for humanity.\"*\n\nAnd then I was taken to the tower… But it doesn't matter! Regressor? Tower? Trials? Whatever it is, It doesn't matter but what I know is I'll conquer this goddamn tower!\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
